Kernel-side runtime shim that provides the `rlm` module inside the
Prime Agent IPython kernel. The rlm module exposes the programmatic
interface for spawning recursive sub-agents, managing durable harness
state (memories, skills, subagent specs, prompt notes), and communicating
with the daemon host via comm messages.

The runtime is pure Python and integrates with ipykernel, mcp,
nest-asyncio, and tyro.
